    <body stage="SubtitleEdit">
        <part updateMethod="0" lastModifyTime="0">
            <t hasRuby="0" index="1" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:04,550</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:09,640</end-time>
                <translation>有一本众多哲学家和作家深爱不已的佛教书籍</translation>
                <original>数多くの哲学者や作家が愛してやまなかった仏教書があります</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="2" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:13,620</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:15,760</end-time>
                <translation>《叹异抄》</translation>
                <original>歎異抄</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="3" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:15,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:21,000</end-time>
                <translation>——是传达镰仓时代僧人亲鸾教诲的语录及其解说
鎌倉時代の僧親鸞の教えを伝える語録とその解説です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="4" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:25,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:33,025</end-time>
                <translation>书中写满了颠覆佛教印象的出人意料的话语</translation>
                <original>書かれているのは仏教のイメージを覆す意外な言葉の数々</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="5" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:33,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:36,100</end-time>
                <translation>其中展现了亲鸾凝视着人的阴影</translation>
                <original>そこには人間の影を見つめ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="6" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:36,100</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:40,875</end-time>
                <translation>即使如此仍主张人可得救的身影</translation>
                <original>それでも人は救われると説いた親鸞の姿がありました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="7" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:42,775</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:46,024</end-time>
                <translation>《100分de名著》将用四周时间</translation>
                <original>100分de名著4週にわたって</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="8" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:00:46,024</start-time>
                <end-time>00:00:48,080</end-time>
                <translation>探寻《叹异抄》的魅力
歎異抄の魅力に迫ります</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="9" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:10,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:16,125</end-time>
                <translation>第1回　凝视人的阴影
第1回　人間の影を見つめて</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="10" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:17,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:19,875</end-time>
                <translation>《100分钟名著》主持人矶野佑子
100分de名著司会の磯野祐子です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="11" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:19,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:21,050</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院光
伊集院光です</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="12" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:21,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:24,025</end-time>
                <translation>从这次开始 我矶野将与伊集院一起
今回から私磯野が伊住院さんと一緒に</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="13" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:24,025</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:26,450</end-time>
                <translation>学习名著的魅力</translation>
                <original>名著の魅力を学んでいくことになりました</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="14" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:26,450</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:29,200</end-time>
                <translation>请多多关照</translation>
                <original>どうぞよろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="15" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:29,200</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:33,150</end-time>
                <translation>那么 本月要介绍的名著就是这本</translation>
                <original>さあ今月ご紹介する名著がこちらです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="16" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:33,150</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:36,408</end-time>
                <translation>读作《Tan ni syou》</translation>
                <original>これで歎異抄と読むんですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="17" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:36,408</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:38,440</end-time>
                <translation>伊集院 你知道这本书吗？</translation>
                <original>伊住院さんこの本ご存知でしたか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="18" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:38,440</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:41,475</end-time>
                <translation>完全不知道 连读法都不清楚呢</translation>
                <original>全く知らなかった読み方もわからなかったですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="19" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:41,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:46,250</end-time>
                <translation>是的 这是大约730年前写成的关于佛教的书</translation>
                <original>ええ730年ほど前に書かれました仏教についての本です</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="20" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:46,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:48,875</end-time>
                <translation>虽然是那么久远时代的书</translation>
                <original>そんな前の時代の本なんですけれども</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="21" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:48,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:53,075</end-time>
                <translation>但比如上个月本节目介绍的司马辽太郎
例えば先月この番組でご紹介した司馬遼太郎さん</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="22" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:53,075</start-time>
                <end-time>00:01:57,375</end-time>
                <translation>据说他在被征召的战场上一直贴身携带</translation>
                <original>招集された戦地で肌身離さずさず持ち歩いていたそうなんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="23" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:01:58,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:02,250</end-time>
                <translation>他甚至说如果只能带一本书去无人岛 就带这本</translation>
                <original>無人島に一冊持っていくならこの本だとまでおっしゃってるんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="24" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:02,250</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:03,735</end-time>
                <translation>真厉害啊</translation>
                <original>すごいですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="25" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:03,735</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:05,725</end-time>
                <translation>一下子就被吸引住了</translation>
                <original>俄然心つかまりましたんで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="26" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:05,725</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:08,875</end-time>
                <translation>那我们赶紧请老师来学习吧</translation>
                <original>あの早速をお呼びして学びましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="27" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:08,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:13,060</end-time>
                <translation>那么 请允许我介绍为我们讲解《叹异抄》魅力的指导老师</translation>
                <original>では歎異抄の魅力を教えてくださる指南役をご紹介しましょう</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="28" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:13,060</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:14,280</end-time>
                <translation>有请</translation>
                <original>どうぞ</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="29" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:16,405</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:20,300</end-time>
                <translation>是僧侣同时也是宗教学者的释彻宗</translation>
                <original>僧侶で宗教学者でもいらっしゃる釈徹宗さんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="30" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:20,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:22,900</end-time>
                <translation>-请多多关照　-请多多关照</translation>
                <original>-よろしくお願いします　-よろしくお願いいたします</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="31" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:22,900</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:24,360</end-time>
                <translation>关于《叹异抄》 直截了当地说 </translation>
                <original>歎異抄ですが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="32" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:24,360</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:26,475</end-time>
                <translation>这是一本什么样的书呢？</translation>
                <original>ずばりどんな本と言えるんでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="33" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:26,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:29,300</end-time>
                <translation>-伊集院的话 -嗯</translation>
                <original>-あの伊集院さんなんかは -はい</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="34" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:29,300</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:33,125</end-time>
                <translation>听到佛教 你会有什么印象呢？</translation>
                <original>仏教と聞けばどういうイメージをお持ちでしょうか</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="35" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:33,125</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:35,601</end-time>
                <translation>通过修行开悟的</translation>
                <original>修行をして悟りを開いた</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="36" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:35,601</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:38,425</end-time>
                <translation>令人感激的僧侣</translation>
                <original>ありがたいお坊さんが</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="37" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:38,425</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:42,500</end-time>
                <translation>教导我们人生的艰难与珍贵</translation>
                <original>人生の難しさや尊さみたいなことを教えてくれる</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="38" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:42,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:44,525</end-time>
                <translation>大概就是这样的印象吧</translation>
                <original>そういうのがじゃないですかね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="39" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:44,525</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:46,845</end-time>
                <translation>这种对佛教的印象</translation>
                <original>そういう仏教のイメージを</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="40" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:46,845</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:51,325</end-time>
                <translation>我认为这一章具有将其颠覆的力量</translation>
                <original>ひっくり返すだけの力を持った章というふうに思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="41" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:51,325</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:54,453</end-time>
                <translation>有时如同利刃抵喉般</translation>
                <original>時に喉元に刃を突きつけるような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="42" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:54,453</start-time>
                <end-time>00:02:56,050</end-time>
                <translation>那种严厉</translation>
                <original>そういう厳しさも</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="43" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:02:56,050</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:00,850</end-time>
                <translation>而且这本书还附有“不可随便给人看”</translation>
                <original>でまたこの書はむやみに人に読ませてはいけないっていうような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="44" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:00,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:02,925</end-time>
                <translation>这样的注意事项</translation>
                <original>注意書きまでついているような</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="45" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:02,925</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:06,760</end-time>
                <translation>-为什么呢？　-意思是容易被误解</translation>
                <original>-なんでなんですか　-誤解されやすいという意味なんですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="46" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:06,760</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:11,175</end-time>
                <translation>因此对读者有所提醒</translation>
                <original>それで読む人には注意をということがありますので</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="47" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:11,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:14,475</end-time>
                <translation>我们接下来也要避免误解</translation>
                <original>我々もこれから誤解しないように</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="48" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:14,475</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:17,500</end-time>
                <translation>要认真仔细地阅读</translation>
                <original>丁寧に読んでいきたいと思います</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="49" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:17,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:03:22,275</end-time>
                <translation>僧侣、宗教学者释彻宗
僧侶宗教学者の釈徹宗さん</translation>
                <original/>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="50" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:03:22,275</start-time>
