            <t hasRuby="0" index="149" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:08:59,875</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:02,000</end-time>
                <translation>在那一边什么都不做才是最好的</translation>
                <original>そっちで何もしないのが一番いいです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="150" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:02,000</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:03,321</end-time>
                <translation>就是这么回事</translation>
                <original>そういうことですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="151" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:03,321</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:05,040</end-time>
                <translation>-不过那种人确实会出现吧　-会出现</translation>
                <original>-でもそういうやつ出ますよね　-出ますね</original>
