            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="152" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:05,040</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:09,375</end-time>
                <translation>一到关键时刻 人们往往就会觉得他总会有办法的</translation>
                <original>いざっていう時には何とかしてるんだろうっていう風になりがちだと思うんです</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="153" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:09,375</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:12,225</end-time>
                <translation>“他力本愿”这个俗语也很常用呢</translation>
                <original>他力本願なんて使われますよね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="154" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:12,225</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:13,500</end-time>
                <translation>指自己不努力</translation>
                <original>自分で努力しないで</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="155" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:13,500</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:16,850</end-time>
                <translation>想做什么就做什么 全靠他人“他力本愿”</translation>
                <original>思いのそれのやり方 他力本願じゃないかって言うけど</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="156" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:16,850</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:18,700</end-time>
                <translation>和这里的“他力”是同一个“他力”吗</translation>
