                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="162" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:32,675</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:34,386</end-time>
                <translation>还有“变得有顶天（得意忘形）”之类的</translation>
                <original>「有頂天になる」とかですね</original>
                <spell/>
            </t>
            <t hasRuby="0" index="163" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:09:34,386</start-time>
                <end-time>00:09:38,875</end-time>
                <translation>这些本来是佛教重要的教义</translation>
                <original>これ本来仏教の大切な教えなんですけども</original>
