            <t hasRuby="0" index="241" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:37,700</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:40,880</end-time>
                <translation>啊 那段“我想请和尚给起个长寿的名字</translation>
                <original>あっお坊さんに長生きする名前つけてほしいんだけど</original>
