            <t hasRuby="0" index="243" id="" time="" vertical="0" torder="1">
                <start-time>00:13:43,175</start-time>
                <end-time>00:13:45,825</end-time>
                <translation>在《无量寿经》这部宝贵的经典中</translation>
                <original>無量寿経というありがたい経の中に</original>
